Package: clevo-keyboard-dkms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dkms, kmod, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-amd64
Conflicts: clevo-keyboard
Replaces: clevo-keyboard
Provides: clevo-keyboard
Homepage: https://github.com/tuxedocomputers/tuxedo-drivers
Description: Patched Clevo keyboard driver, rebuilt on kernel upgrades by DKMS
 Clevo laptop keyboard modules (clevo_keyboard, clevo_wmi, clevo_acpi) from
 the patched tuxedo-keyboard tree.
 .
 The source is dpkg-owned under /usr/src and registers with dkms solely
 through debhelper snippets; no maintainer script copies a payload or removes
 one with a glob. This package deposes Juno's clevo-keyboard, whose postinst
 cp'd an unowned tree into /usr/src.
